00:20:27.000 --> 00:21:12.000
The driver remained motionless in the vehicle for some time before driving away The car was traced to a woman who resided in a nearby suburb When questioned, she claimed that her boyfriend was driving her car He lived in very close proximity to 657 boulevard However, at the time, he was living in a different location She said her boyfriend was known to play some really dark video games One character he played was called the Watcher Police contacted the boyfriend who agreed to an interview
司机在车里静止了一段时间才开走。这辆车被追溯到住在附近郊区的一名女子。当被盘问时，她声称她的男朋友开着她的车。他住在离布勒瓦德657号非常近的地方。然而，当时他住在另一个地方。她说她的男朋友以玩一些非常黑暗的视频游戏而闻名。他玩的一个角色叫守望者。警方联系了同意接受采访的男朋友。

